# Pairs with AdminScopedToOwnSide. Only the grantee decides what lands in its
# view; accepting either party's admin lets the granting side answer.
MODULE: AnswerFromEitherSide
TARGET: AdminScopedToOwnSide
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: approve and reject accept either party's admin, as revoke does
PERTURBS: Answer

--- FIND
        a == AuthorizeAdmin(c, "B")
--- REPLACE
        a == IF TryAuthorizeAdmin(c, "A") THEN "ok" ELSE AuthorizeAdmin(c, "B")
--- END